            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[A proper first run: Firstlight now shows a new person around — your day and your agents, your friends and the leaderboard — before it asks for a photo, a name and what friends may see.

Also in this version: the Agents screen with cost, streak and records; group invitations a friend can accept or decline; the day drawn as half-hour columns by tool; a handshake when a friend joins.
]]></description>
